import json,numpy as np
from rcb_client import Robot
from PIL import Image
r=Robot();s=r.spec();ranges=np.array(s['qpos']['range']); names=s['qpos']['layout'];jn=s['proprio']['joints']
def action(q):return np.clip(2*(np.array(q)-ranges[:,0])/(ranges[:,1]-ranges[:,0])-1,-1,1)
def measured(o):
 d=dict(zip(jn,o['proprio']['joint_pos']));q=[]
 for n in names:
  if '_A_' not in n:q.append(d[n])
  else:
   n=n.replace('_A_','_');q.append(d[n] if not n.endswith('J0') else d[n[:-1]+'1']+d[n[:-1]+'2'])
 return np.array(q)
def save(o,tag='current'):
 for k,v in o['images'].items():Image.fromarray(v).save('/app/output/'+tag+'_'+k+'.png')
 np.savez('/app/output/current.npz',q=measured(o),gravity=o['imu']['gravity'],gyro=o['imu']['gyro'])
 print('step',o['step'],'done',o['done'],o['reason'],'resets',o['resets_left'],'imu',o['imu']);print('body',np.round(measured(o)[:21],3))
def hold(q,n=10,tag='current'):
 o=r.step('qpos',np.tile(action(q),(n,1)));save(o,tag);return o
if __name__=='__main__':
 o=r.observe(False);q=measured(o);hold(q,20)
PY
